1
00:00:01,283 --> 00:02:03,863
Visit our website for more: turkision.com

2
00:02:04,144 --> 00:02:08,413
No living being was harmed during the
filming of this series.

3
00:02:33,966 --> 00:02:36,125
You'll stop, Nayman.

4
00:02:36,486 --> 00:02:41,045
- You and your soldiers will stop.
- Who will make me?

5
00:02:47,966 --> 00:02:50,205
Cengiz Khan's seal.

6
00:03:04,726 --> 00:03:06,325
Soldiers!

7
00:03:09,686 --> 00:03:11,565
Attack!

8
00:03:12,086 --> 00:03:14,325
Attack!

9
00:03:15,686 --> 00:03:17,205
Attack!

10
00:03:19,046 --> 00:03:22,125
It's commander Nayman's order!

11
00:03:22,406 --> 00:03:25,205
I'm the real owner of the seal.

12
00:03:27,886 --> 00:03:31,885
You... You did this Osman.

13
00:03:33,196 --> 00:03:34,835
You were gaining time.

14
00:03:35,136 --> 00:03:38,095
You were the one who
wanted to gain time.

15
00:03:38,766 --> 00:03:41,285
I came face to face with you.

16
00:03:41,966 --> 00:03:44,245
You were the one who
put forward the Alps.

17
00:03:44,766 --> 00:03:47,605
What's wrong? Your
plan didn't work?

18
00:03:48,126 --> 00:03:50,605
Is that why you are barking like a dog?

19
00:03:50,846 --> 00:03:55,085
I swear to Sky Tengri, I'll kill you!

20
00:03:55,406 --> 00:03:57,245
I will!

21
00:04:00,086 --> 00:04:02,925
Marmaracık Castle

22
00:04:07,526 --> 00:04:09,245
Aktemur.

23
00:04:10,046 --> 00:04:15,005
When my mother finds out about the plan
you played with Osman Bey, it won't be good.

24
00:04:17,166 --> 00:04:18,524
Alçiçek.

25
00:04:20,366 --> 00:04:22,565
You know that I had to do it.

26
00:04:23,446 --> 00:04:25,685
Bengi Mother will understand me.

27
00:04:47,846 --> 00:04:50,005
Thank Allah.

28
00:04:58,526 --> 00:05:01,285
Mashallah to my children!

29
00:05:03,886 --> 00:05:08,405
You took back what my Öktem
entrusted to us. Thank Allah.

30
00:05:11,526 --> 00:05:15,725
We did , mother. We took
revenge of our soldiers.

31
00:05:20,246 --> 00:05:23,805
I knew you wouldn't
fail me, son.

32
00:05:33,086 --> 00:05:35,125
Thanks mother.

33
00:05:36,766 --> 00:05:38,685
We took the castle.

34
00:05:40,246 --> 00:05:42,485
It will be Nayman's turn now.

35
00:05:43,886 --> 00:05:45,845
Inshallah.

36
00:05:49,086 --> 00:05:51,005
My daughter!

37
00:05:54,606 --> 00:05:59,525
On the way, the Alps talked
about your skills. Mashallah.

38
00:06:03,486 --> 00:06:05,925
Who helped you from inside?

39
00:06:10,086 --> 00:06:13,725
Mother, who is going to help us?
There's no such thing.

40
00:06:16,606 --> 00:06:18,965
Alps and Alçiçek entered
through the secret passage.

41
00:06:19,445 --> 00:06:22,265
They were probably
talking about that.

42
00:06:23,606 --> 00:06:25,085
Good.

43
00:06:30,126 --> 00:06:31,965
Send the news!

44
00:06:32,326 --> 00:06:36,245
Say that, Aktemur, the Bey of Kargın Tribe,

45
00:06:36,686 --> 00:06:39,405
made Marmaracık a Turkish homeland again!

46
00:06:48,006 --> 00:06:49,645
Let's go.

47
00:06:50,606 --> 00:06:52,565
We have many things to do.

48
00:06:53,366 --> 00:06:56,525
Aktemur Bey, let's clean our lands...

49
00:06:57,566 --> 00:07:01,045
which were polluted by infidels.

50
00:07:13,526 --> 00:07:16,845
Drop your sword and
surrender, Nayman!

51
00:07:16,966 --> 00:07:18,765
Never!

52
00:07:20,646 --> 00:07:22,165
Catch him.

53
00:08:07,016 --> 00:08:08,575
Stop Shaman, too!

54
00:08:17,686 --> 00:08:22,405
I won't die today
to kill you, Osman!

55
00:08:22,886 --> 00:08:25,165
I will come to kill you!

56
00:08:25,486 --> 00:08:30,205
Your end has come.
You cannot kill me.

57
00:08:30,726 --> 00:08:34,965
You won't even be able to build a state.

58
00:08:35,486 --> 00:08:37,325
Come on.

59
00:08:38,046 --> 00:08:40,845
- Osman!
- Take him.

60
00:08:59,766 --> 00:09:03,965
- So you are Osman Bey.
- So, you are Gazan Khan's commander.

61
00:09:05,206 --> 00:09:07,965
Bagatur.
Commander Bagatur.

62
00:09:08,446 --> 00:09:10,005
I understand.

63
00:09:10,686 --> 00:09:14,005
- Welcome, Commander.
- Thank you, Osman Bey.

64
00:09:14,476 --> 00:09:17,115
We received the letter you
made Sultan Alaaddin send to us.

65
00:09:17,125 --> 00:09:20,524
When we found Talay, Turgut
Bey had already killed him.

66
00:09:21,006 --> 00:09:24,645
And we came to your
land with Turgut Bey.

67
00:09:25,726 --> 00:09:27,565
We captured this traitor.

68
00:09:27,806 --> 00:09:29,045
Commander.

69
00:09:29,926 --> 00:09:32,125
This traitor will
never be free!

70
00:09:32,606 --> 00:09:37,405
You can be sure.
I didn't come here to free the traitor.

71
00:09:38,286 --> 00:09:40,485
He has no power now.

72
00:09:40,606 --> 00:09:43,645
But my Alps have to come with you...

73
00:09:44,266 --> 00:09:47,025
...for me to not worry.

74
00:09:48,926 --> 00:09:51,885
Don't you trust us, Osman Bey?

75
00:09:55,766 --> 00:10:00,645
I do but precaution does not harm us.

76
00:10:06,086 --> 00:10:09,365
Soldiers!
We are going back!

77
00:10:11,166 --> 00:10:13,725
Alps will accompany us.

78
00:10:15,606 --> 00:10:18,685
- May you go safely.
- Thank you.

79
00:10:19,206 --> 00:10:21,045
Alps!

80
00:10:22,566 --> 00:10:25,525
You will accompany the Commander.
Come on!

81
00:10:48,326 --> 00:10:49,805
Alps!

82
00:10:50,446 --> 00:10:53,045
Have a good rest.

83
00:10:54,606 --> 00:10:58,205
We'll keep conquering lands.
The war has just started for us!

84
00:10:58,886 --> 00:11:01,085
Yes, my Bey.

85
00:11:03,976 --> 00:11:07,455
We're going to Turgut Bey.
Come on.

86
00:11:30,646 --> 00:11:33,605
Where are they taking
Nayman, Mother Sultan?

87
00:11:34,086 --> 00:11:37,165
Osman is playing a game, Celali.

88
00:11:37,366 --> 00:11:39,725
But we will find out what it is.

89
00:11:41,336 --> 00:11:45,375
- Any news from Karavul?
- He knows we'll meet here.

90
00:11:47,526 --> 00:11:48,965
Good.

91
00:12:04,486 --> 00:12:06,725
Karavul..

92
00:12:09,236 --> 00:12:11,235
You will go after Nayman.

93
00:12:11,786 --> 00:12:15,305
You will walk in
the dark.

94
00:12:16,326 --> 00:12:20,685
You will learn where they are going
and what they are up to.

95
00:12:21,046 --> 00:12:24,045
Your command, the owner
of the Seljuk state.

96
00:12:29,206 --> 00:12:32,485
Osman left the field
with a victory today.

97
00:12:32,846 --> 00:12:37,765
His control over the borders will be
stronger. Beys will gather behind him.

98
00:12:38,726 --> 00:12:41,605
But I will prevent this from happening.

99
00:12:43,126 --> 00:12:44,685
Come on.

100
00:12:58,606 --> 00:13:03,485
My Bey... I put acacia herb in it.
It will heal your eyes.

101
00:13:04,966 --> 00:13:06,845
O healer.

102
00:13:19,566 --> 00:13:21,805
Thank you.

103
00:13:23,806 --> 00:13:26,725
Thank you, Kumral Abdal. Thank you.

104
00:13:28,086 --> 00:13:30,125
Turgut Bey is coming

105
00:13:45,486 --> 00:13:47,045
Osman Bey...

106
00:13:51,766 --> 00:13:53,605
My Osman Bey..

107
00:13:54,766 --> 00:13:57,445
- Are you okay?
- I am okay.

108
00:13:57,646 --> 00:13:59,485
I am fine, don't worry.

109
00:13:59,686 --> 00:14:03,285
Thank you. You've done
a very tough duty.

110
00:14:03,406 --> 00:14:07,745
We handled it with our minds, what
we couldn't handle with our hands.

111
00:14:07,805 --> 00:14:11,164
Yes! Good!

112
00:14:11,886 --> 00:14:15,125
- Are you alright?
- I am, I am, don't worry.

113
00:14:15,646 --> 00:14:17,965
Thanks to Kumral Abdal.

114
00:14:19,166 --> 00:14:21,925
My Bey, we were waiting for your
order with our bows.

115
00:14:22,216 --> 00:14:26,375
However, Nayman wasn't granted with the
rope of the bow, but the hangman's knot!

116
00:14:27,126 --> 00:14:30,125
Gazan Khan will deal with
the Nayman issue now.

117
00:14:30,886 --> 00:14:36,325
Now... they will be after them as a
precaution until they leave our lands.

118
00:14:38,286 --> 00:14:40,845
Now, Nayman is not our issue.

119
00:14:41,086 --> 00:14:45,525
Our issue is conquest, as always.

120
00:14:45,646 --> 00:14:47,565
It is conquest!

121
00:14:49,236 --> 00:14:52,325
Alps! We will never stop.

122
00:14:52,886 --> 00:14:55,165
We will keep going.

123
00:14:56,446 --> 00:15:00,525
Now... All of you will
gather information for me.

124
00:15:00,926 --> 00:15:04,245
And we will detect the places
that are closest to the conquest.

125
00:15:05,726 --> 00:15:07,125
Cerkutay.

126
00:15:07,976 --> 00:15:10,575
- My Bey.
- Geyve area is yours.

127
00:15:10,946 --> 00:15:14,545
Spy that place and bring me all the
information.

128
00:15:15,396 --> 00:15:17,035
Yes my Bey.

129
00:15:17,516 --> 00:15:19,395
- Aykurt.
- My Bey.

130
00:15:20,366 --> 00:15:23,165
- You will deal with Akhisar.
- Yes my Bey.

131
00:15:24,096 --> 00:15:27,295
Şamil! You will go to Tekirpınar Castle.

132
00:15:27,846 --> 00:15:29,685
Yes, my Bey.

133
00:15:30,126 --> 00:15:33,005
- Baysungur.
- I'm listening my Bey.

134
00:15:33,156 --> 00:15:36,355
- You'll deal with Güblüce.
- Yes, my Bey.

135
00:15:37,926 --> 00:15:40,405
- Gürbüz.
- My Bey.

136
00:15:40,796 --> 00:15:44,115
- You will deal with Kızılhisar.
- Yes, my Bey.

137
00:15:45,646 --> 00:15:47,645
Konur.

138
00:15:48,606 --> 00:15:50,555
You will go to Köprühisar.

139
00:15:50,590 --> 00:15:53,870
I want to be informed about the condition
of the citadel in detail.

140
00:15:54,006 --> 00:15:56,365
Yes, my Bey.

141
00:15:56,956 --> 00:15:59,075
- Turgut.
- Tell me.

142
00:15:59,216 --> 00:16:03,695
I will not let you rest.
Only our death can stop us.

143
00:16:04,846 --> 00:16:07,445
You'll prepare conquest
equipments for us.

144
00:16:07,796 --> 00:16:11,235
- Your command.
- Thank you.

145
00:16:12,366 --> 00:16:15,165
- Turahan.
- My Bey.

146
00:16:16,406 --> 00:16:20,325
Go to the tribe of Bayram Bey, who was
martyred. Meet all their needs.

147
00:16:20,646 --> 00:16:22,285
Yes, my Bey.

148
00:16:22,766 --> 00:16:27,205
Alps. I want to have all the
information until iftar.

149
00:16:27,566 --> 00:16:30,005
Intelligence is the key to victory.

150
00:16:30,446 --> 00:16:31,325
Come on, Alps.

151
00:16:31,646 --> 00:16:34,565
- Yes, my Bey
- Yes, my Bey

152
00:16:56,886 --> 00:16:59,405
- My Bey.
- My children.

153
00:17:00,806 --> 00:17:02,525
Come here.

154
00:17:30,416 --> 00:17:32,725
Bagatur!

155
00:17:34,486 --> 00:17:38,125
Cengiz's seal is mine!

156
00:17:42,166 --> 00:17:44,245
You took my seal!

157
00:17:44,886 --> 00:17:49,005
And I will kill you!

158
00:17:50,326 --> 00:17:53,125
With which power, Nayman?

159
00:17:53,846 --> 00:17:57,325
Do you trust a few marauders
from your army?

160
00:18:01,046 --> 00:18:06,125
A brave person is better
than a thousand cowards.

161
00:18:07,306 --> 00:18:10,225
I'll be enough for all of you!

162
00:18:10,446 --> 00:18:12,485
All of you!

163
00:18:13,006 --> 00:18:16,845
You only gnaw the state...

164
00:18:16,865 --> 00:18:19,704
that Cengiz Khan established.

165
00:18:20,166 --> 00:18:24,925
But you will be punished accordingly.

166
00:18:26,806 --> 00:18:29,845
You will not be saved from
Gazan Khan's wrath.

167
00:18:32,646 --> 00:18:37,125
No one against Sky
Tengri will hurt great Nayman.

168
00:18:38,126 --> 00:18:41,125
You are responsible
for all of this, Shaman.

169
00:18:41,586 --> 00:18:44,985
We will soon arrive Tebriz.
Let us get there,

170
00:18:45,526 --> 00:18:48,285
then you will be punished as well!

171
00:19:11,086 --> 00:19:12,845
Brothers.

172
00:19:13,446 --> 00:19:18,285
We'll part ways soon.
Let me give you some clues.

173
00:19:19,166 --> 00:19:22,125
- What clue is that?
- You know,

174
00:19:22,926 --> 00:19:26,845
what is spying and how to spy.

175
00:19:30,566 --> 00:19:32,125
For example...

176
00:19:33,446 --> 00:19:37,845
this road leads to Geyve.
Look how I found my way!

177
00:19:40,886 --> 00:19:43,605
We know as much as you do.

178
00:19:45,766 --> 00:19:47,725
As much as me?

179
00:19:49,446 --> 00:19:54,165
For example, what would you do if
you were about to be exposed in an infidel city?

180
00:19:54,286 --> 00:19:56,085
How can you escape?

181
00:19:56,566 --> 00:19:59,565
How can you disguise?
Do you know that?

182
00:19:59,966 --> 00:20:03,885
I know. I was with infidels
for years...

183
00:20:04,286 --> 00:20:06,845
and I didn't expose anything.

184
00:20:08,406 --> 00:20:11,605
Cerkutay, why are you boasting?

185
00:20:12,726 --> 00:20:16,125
For example, Konur brother
is also very competent at spying.

186
00:20:16,286 --> 00:20:17,925
Thank you.

187
00:20:18,916 --> 00:20:23,515
When I was in Köprühisar, I got
over many troubles,

188
00:20:23,806 --> 00:20:27,125
but I didn't give up. Why?

189
00:20:27,606 --> 00:20:30,485
Because Cerkutay does not give up.

190
00:20:33,566 --> 00:20:39,285
Oh, İnegöl. I disguised many
times before Olof's eyes...

191
00:20:39,686 --> 00:20:42,125
and nobody realized.

192
00:20:44,006 --> 00:20:47,805
You have a lot to learn from Cerkutay.

193
00:20:57,126 --> 00:21:01,205
Oh, Cerkutay.
They won't understand, anyway.

194
00:21:03,206 --> 00:21:05,005
Let's go.

195
00:21:42,206 --> 00:21:44,405
Still no news.

196
00:21:45,206 --> 00:21:50,005
- It's so hard to wait.
- Are you worried about Cerkutay Alp?

197
00:21:53,206 --> 00:21:55,245
Don't be.

198
00:21:56,446 --> 00:22:00,125
Don't be afraid. He has double
swords, so he will be alright.

199
00:22:00,446 --> 00:22:01,805
Inshallah.

200
00:22:26,766 --> 00:22:29,045
Who are you waiting for, girl?

201
00:22:29,766 --> 00:22:32,485
Cerku... Mother!

202
00:22:34,246 --> 00:22:36,365
I'm not waiting for anyone.

203
00:22:37,206 --> 00:22:40,165
Alps... Yes.
They're in a battle.

204
00:22:40,486 --> 00:22:44,845
If you're waiting for nobody,
why are you watching the gate?

205
00:22:46,286 --> 00:22:50,525
I was just looking...
Because of the battle, you know.

206
00:22:55,526 --> 00:22:59,605
- Do you have someone in your heart?
- No. It's empty.

207
00:23:00,806 --> 00:23:03,565
My heart is empty.

208
00:23:08,006 --> 00:23:09,965
Are you sure?

209
00:23:16,446 --> 00:23:18,045
Mother.

210
00:23:22,966 --> 00:23:26,165
Mother! They're here!

211
00:23:26,886 --> 00:23:28,845
They're here.

212
00:23:30,086 --> 00:23:33,005
Welcome. Welcome.

213
00:23:33,686 --> 00:23:35,885
You saved me!

214
00:23:36,086 --> 00:23:39,045
Ülgen, any news from Osman Bey?

215
00:23:39,366 --> 00:23:41,725
No.
We were waiting too.

216
00:23:42,606 --> 00:23:45,565
What about you?
Did you take the citadel?

217
00:23:46,766 --> 00:23:49,765
Yes, we did.
Did you have doubts?

218
00:23:50,206 --> 00:23:51,485
No.

219
00:23:51,726 --> 00:23:54,605
Mashallah, hatuns.

220
00:23:54,846 --> 00:24:00,925
If I wasn't old, I'd go with you
and behead the infidels!

221
00:24:04,366 --> 00:24:07,045
You're not that old, midwife.

222
00:24:07,086 --> 00:24:10,805
Mashallah, you can still draw swords.

223
00:24:24,806 --> 00:24:26,885
I've brought news from Osman Bey.

224
00:24:27,046 --> 00:24:29,365
Are they okay?
What about the battle?

225
00:24:29,486 --> 00:24:33,005
They're all good.
The result is victory.

226
00:24:34,486 --> 00:24:38,485
He invited Beys for an iftar dinner
and he told me to let you know.

227
00:24:41,126 --> 00:24:43,365
Thank Allah.

228
00:24:46,126 --> 00:24:47,565
Yes, thank Allah.

229
00:24:48,086 --> 00:24:49,685
For iftar?

230
00:24:50,166 --> 00:24:52,045
Today?

231
00:24:52,486 --> 00:24:55,845
Beys? A feast?
Oh Allah!

232
00:24:56,606 --> 00:24:59,885
How can we cook so much food?
Run, Esma!

233
00:25:00,606 --> 00:25:03,765
- Run, Esma.
- Come on!

234
00:25:21,846 --> 00:25:23,325
Sons.

235
00:25:24,126 --> 00:25:27,325
You must be wondering why we are here.

236
00:25:28,566 --> 00:25:30,205
Look arond.

237
00:25:32,446 --> 00:25:35,485
We're at Avdan Mountain.

238
00:25:39,326 --> 00:25:44,445
If you go that way, you
will end up in Köprühisar.

239
00:25:48,126 --> 00:25:50,485
If you go that way,

240
00:25:50,566 --> 00:25:54,845
...then infidels will be
waiting for you in Kızılhisar.

241
00:25:56,846 --> 00:25:58,685
All around the mountain...

242
00:25:58,846 --> 00:26:02,725
there are citadels and castles that our
Alps have gone to discover.

243
00:26:03,526 --> 00:26:07,005
You say there are many
obstacles in our route, my Bey.

244
00:26:07,646 --> 00:26:12,405
Not obstacles, my Bey says we have
much work and many conquests ahead.

245
00:26:14,406 --> 00:26:19,405
When the citadels mentioned are defeated,
two ways leading to İznik will be opened.

246
00:26:21,526 --> 00:26:26,725
You say nobody can stop us from capturing
İznik and the towns around, brother.

247
00:26:34,326 --> 00:26:37,285
Sons, I say just one...

248
00:26:37,486 --> 00:26:40,885
...but you hear a thousand.
Mashallah!

249
00:26:45,126 --> 00:26:48,165
Our destination and target are certain.

250
00:26:48,726 --> 00:26:51,285
When ALps bring information,

251
00:26:51,686 --> 00:26:54,885
we'll choose a way.

252
00:26:55,726 --> 00:26:59,285
- Your command, my Bey.
- Your command, my Bey.

253
00:27:00,526 --> 00:27:03,925
Thank you, my brave sons.
Let's go!

254
00:27:26,166 --> 00:27:29,845
Soldiers, leave him and get out.

255
00:27:40,126 --> 00:27:43,165
I got your note, Bayindir.

256
00:27:56,366 --> 00:27:58,365
Mashallah.

257
00:27:58,526 --> 00:28:01,485
You explained everything in detail...

258
00:28:01,766 --> 00:28:04,245
Bayındır.

259
00:28:07,726 --> 00:28:10,445
How you served Nayman like a dog.

260
00:28:12,806 --> 00:28:15,405
How you sold me out.

261
00:28:15,926 --> 00:28:19,125
How you got defeated by Turgut.

262
00:28:21,086 --> 00:28:25,605
Sun of Seljuks, Mighty Mother
Sultan, please forgive me!

263
00:28:25,606 --> 00:28:27,925
I messed everything up!

264
00:28:28,166 --> 00:28:31,045
That's why I wrote what
I did in the note.

265
00:28:31,246 --> 00:28:34,325
In case you spare my life.

266
00:28:34,526 --> 00:28:38,205
Great Mother Sultan, forgive me.

267
00:28:48,566 --> 00:28:53,245
Well thought, Bayındır.
Very well thought!

268
00:28:54,446 --> 00:28:57,445
If you hadn't sent me this note,

269
00:28:58,046 --> 00:29:01,685
you'd be dead as soon as you enter Söğüt.

270
00:29:08,486 --> 00:29:11,365
But I won't forgive you anyway, Bayındır.

271
00:29:13,046 --> 00:29:16,565
You cut off my head, Mighty Mother Sultan.

272
00:29:16,846 --> 00:29:20,805
Instead of Osman or the
dog called Nayman,

273
00:29:21,006 --> 00:29:24,885
I'd prefer Mother Sultan, the undying
sun of Seljuks to cut... --

274
00:29:24,886 --> 00:29:26,125
Shut up!

275
00:29:27,406 --> 00:29:29,285
Stop trembling before me!

276
00:29:29,686 --> 00:29:33,645
You've lived dishonorably.
Die honorably, at least.

277
00:29:34,046 --> 00:29:36,245
Haven't you disgraced yourself enough?

278
00:29:36,486 --> 00:29:41,565
Mighty Mother Sultan, I
swear on Allah and everything.

279
00:29:41,966 --> 00:29:46,845
I want to live just to undo
my disgraceful actions!

280
00:29:47,926 --> 00:29:52,365
I'm begging for one last chance.
One last chance.

281
00:29:57,846 --> 00:30:00,045
One last chance.

282
00:30:05,846 --> 00:30:07,605
So be it.

283
00:30:18,846 --> 00:30:22,165
One last chance.

284
00:30:26,206 --> 00:30:30,925
You'll clean all the dirty things
you've done, Bayındır.

285
00:30:34,166 --> 00:30:36,805
You'll die if I tell you to die.

286
00:30:38,486 --> 00:30:41,845
You'll kill if I tell you to kill.

287
00:30:44,006 --> 00:30:46,725
Your command, Mother Sultan!

288
00:30:46,966 --> 00:30:51,045
I'll sacrifice my life for you if
necessary, Mighty Mother Sultan.

289
00:30:51,366 --> 00:30:54,005
Whatever you wish!

290
00:30:58,126 --> 00:31:00,005
However,

291
00:31:00,566 --> 00:31:03,925
that dog called Nayman will kill me
when he sees me.

292
00:31:04,206 --> 00:31:05,805
What about that?

293
00:31:06,326 --> 00:31:08,485
Don't worry about Nayman.

294
00:31:09,166 --> 00:31:11,365
Osman arrested him.

295
00:31:13,006 --> 00:31:16,325
Now go and wait for my call.

296
00:31:18,926 --> 00:31:22,165
Your command.

297
00:31:38,926 --> 00:31:41,605
Prepare my horse, Celali.

298
00:31:50,366 --> 00:31:53,445
Bayındır.

299
00:31:57,286 --> 00:32:00,325
How can I cook so much in time?

300
00:32:00,726 --> 00:32:02,525
Come on, Esma.

301
00:32:10,966 --> 00:32:14,845
You've done nothing yet?
Esma, get to the dough.

302
00:32:15,246 --> 00:32:17,125
The dark Midwife.

303
00:32:18,566 --> 00:32:21,365
Let me do it, Ülgen.
Come on.

304
00:32:21,846 --> 00:32:24,525
What are you doing?

305
00:32:25,046 --> 00:32:27,445
What does it look like, Ülgen?

306
00:32:28,046 --> 00:32:30,085
I mean... I see, but..

307
00:32:30,246 --> 00:32:33,365
Come on, Ülgen. Stop looking.
Chop the onions.

308
00:32:34,926 --> 00:32:38,005
- I got the bread.
- Good.

309
00:32:39,366 --> 00:32:42,205
Move aside, girl.

310
00:32:50,366 --> 00:32:52,565
Esma.

311
00:32:53,046 --> 00:32:55,485
Are you single?

312
00:32:57,446 --> 00:33:00,045
Do you have anyone in your heart?

313
00:33:01,686 --> 00:33:06,325
Ülgen's heart is empty.
Is yours empty too?

314
00:33:12,686 --> 00:33:17,005
I'll make Ülgen get married first.
Then, you will be the next.

315
00:33:18,046 --> 00:33:21,605
We won't miss Selcan Hatun thanks to
you, right, the dark midwife?

316
00:33:21,966 --> 00:33:23,985
She was just like you.

317
00:33:24,005 --> 00:33:27,785
She'd make us prepare the wedding
ceremony when she saw someone single.

318
00:33:27,806 --> 00:33:30,005
Selcan Hatun...

319
00:33:30,406 --> 00:33:32,645
May Allah let her be in heaven.

320
00:33:32,926 --> 00:33:35,125
- Amin.
- Amin.

321
00:33:36,486 --> 00:33:40,445
But Hatuns, you have never worked.

322
00:33:40,686 --> 00:33:42,965
Yenişehir is full of single people.

323
00:33:43,246 --> 00:33:47,285
But I'll take make them get married.

324
00:33:51,086 --> 00:33:53,245
You are right, the dark midwife.

325
00:33:53,566 --> 00:33:57,365
Hatuns, we have to do
something about this.

326
00:34:00,406 --> 00:34:03,525
Mother! Enough.

327
00:34:03,686 --> 00:34:08,165
You're always talking about marriage!

328
00:34:08,366 --> 00:34:10,405
I am, why do you care?

329
00:34:10,926 --> 00:34:13,364
You talk too much!

330
00:34:13,766 --> 00:34:16,445
You have to marry!

331
00:34:18,686 --> 00:34:22,125
Hatuns!
Do you know any brave single man?

332
00:34:22,485 --> 00:34:24,844
Actually there is someone.

333
00:34:29,525 --> 00:34:32,445
- Don't say it!
- He is...

334
00:34:32,926 --> 00:34:36,485
He is very talented.
He even use double swords!

335
00:34:36,726 --> 00:34:39,965
Mashallah.
Double swords?

336
00:34:41,406 --> 00:34:43,605
Did I see him? Who is that?

337
00:34:43,726 --> 00:34:46,165
You saw him, the dark midwife.

338
00:34:46,726 --> 00:34:47,645
Don't...

339
00:34:47,846 --> 00:34:50,045
One of Osman Bey's Alps...

340
00:34:51,366 --> 00:34:53,605
Cerkutay...

341
00:35:00,686 --> 00:35:03,245
You are talking about that crazy man?

342
00:35:03,246 --> 00:35:05,205
Is he single?

343
00:35:06,926 --> 00:35:10,885
But no. I won't give my daughter
to someone who is crazy.

344
00:35:26,886 --> 00:35:29,285
I'm unfortunate!

345
00:35:29,486 --> 00:35:32,245
I was just about to say
everything is alright.

346
00:35:32,366 --> 00:35:36,285
Now, this happens!

347
00:35:41,486 --> 00:35:43,685
My Allah, give me patience.

348
00:35:44,966 --> 00:35:47,125
Cerkutay, look what you did!

349
00:35:48,526 --> 00:35:50,085
Ülgen.

350
00:35:52,126 --> 00:35:54,315
- Ülgen!
- What?

351
00:35:54,700 --> 00:35:56,800
Why are you crying?

352
00:35:58,286 --> 00:36:00,285
No.
I'm not crying.

353
00:36:17,006 --> 00:36:19,725
Osman Bey is coming!

354
00:36:23,286 --> 00:36:25,765
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

355
00:36:34,926 --> 00:36:37,045
Since you are all here,

356
00:36:37,406 --> 00:36:41,365
it means that missions are completed.
May you all live long.

357
00:36:43,206 --> 00:36:47,325
Now, tell me which fortresses
and castles are wating...

358
00:36:48,406 --> 00:36:50,725
for us to conquest?

359
00:37:05,446 --> 00:37:07,645
- Aykurt.
- My Bey.

360
00:37:16,926 --> 00:37:20,165
Akhisar.
Protected by crossbowmen.

361
00:37:20,646 --> 00:37:23,645
Every corner? Isn't there a way?

362
00:37:23,696 --> 00:37:26,775
No, my Bey. They
are protecting every inch of the castle.

363
00:37:28,486 --> 00:37:31,525
- Anything else?
- The conquest might e hard.

364
00:37:31,686 --> 00:37:33,885
And it's far away from here.

365
00:37:34,366 --> 00:37:37,965
During the siege, our back
will be vulnerable, my Bey.

366
00:37:38,246 --> 00:37:41,605
- This area?
- Yes, my Bey.

367
00:37:43,006 --> 00:37:45,085
Thank you.

368
00:37:46,366 --> 00:37:49,085
- Şamil?
- My Bey.

369
00:37:53,486 --> 00:37:56,325
Tekirpınar Castle is in
the same situation.

370
00:37:56,486 --> 00:37:57,485
Tell me.

371
00:37:57,726 --> 00:38:00,445
Also the soldiers are well trained.

372
00:38:00,766 --> 00:38:03,205
Anything else?

373
00:38:03,446 --> 00:38:06,165
- That's all, my Bey.
- Alright.

374
00:38:11,006 --> 00:38:12,725
My Bey.

375
00:38:14,566 --> 00:38:17,605
To conquer
the castles in question, first of all...

376
00:38:20,806 --> 00:38:22,845
we need to take Geyve Citadel. (castle)

377
00:38:25,446 --> 00:38:28,725
First Geyve, is that so?
Tell me about it.

378
00:38:29,526 --> 00:38:33,685
This is the key my Bey. If
we take it, the rest will come.

379
00:38:34,366 --> 00:38:35,965
But,

380
00:38:36,726 --> 00:38:39,125
the state is the same in here as well.

381
00:38:41,126 --> 00:38:44,565
- The ones that lead...
- What do they say?

382
00:38:45,246 --> 00:38:49,325
They scare people and say
that Turks are cruel.

383
00:38:55,166 --> 00:38:56,325
Okay.

384
00:38:56,686 --> 00:38:58,765
- Baysungur.
- My Bey.

385
00:39:01,966 --> 00:39:04,925
It's the same in Lüblüce, my Bey.

386
00:39:05,306 --> 00:39:08,545
They keep saying Turks are cruel.

387
00:39:11,806 --> 00:39:14,605
Gürbüz, it's the same
there too, I guess.

388
00:39:14,846 --> 00:39:16,325
My Bey.

389
00:39:20,846 --> 00:39:23,605
It's the same in Kızılhisar as well.

390
00:39:25,926 --> 00:39:28,645
Okay.

391
00:39:39,086 --> 00:39:40,965
What about Konur?

392
00:39:44,686 --> 00:39:47,725
Konur is the only one remaining
who did not bring news.

393
00:39:48,566 --> 00:39:50,285
- Boran?
- My Bey.

394
00:39:50,526 --> 00:39:54,005
- Hasn't he arrived yet?
- He'll be here soon, my Bey.

395
00:39:59,406 --> 00:40:00,885
Okay.

396
00:40:02,526 --> 00:40:07,205
We will determine our route based on
the information we will have from Konur.

397
00:40:07,366 --> 00:40:11,005
- Have Konur visit me when he arrives.
- Yes, my Bey.

398
00:41:06,726 --> 00:41:10,365
We will end our fasting in the
caravanserai in Karakuyu.

399
00:41:10,766 --> 00:41:13,565
We will spend the night there.
Take precautions.

400
00:41:17,806 --> 00:41:21,485
Your fast will be broken with
your own blood.

401
00:41:22,086 --> 00:41:24,645
Don't worry, Nayman.

402
00:41:25,566 --> 00:41:30,685
As long as I have the seal, no power
can prevent us from going Tebriz.

403
00:41:32,086 --> 00:41:34,645
You will not be able to save
your head, Nayman.

404
00:42:03,166 --> 00:42:04,765
Tell me.

405
00:42:05,726 --> 00:42:08,885
- Why were you late?
- They know, my Bey.

406
00:42:09,806 --> 00:42:13,965
They know that they have the secret.
They took precautions.

407
00:42:15,806 --> 00:42:18,045
What is the condition of Köprühisar?

408
00:42:22,446 --> 00:42:25,565
Köprühisar is the toughest
place among these, my Bey.

409
00:42:26,246 --> 00:42:30,885
They know that we will come.
They raised the walls.

410
00:42:31,526 --> 00:42:34,165
Workers are doing their
best.

411
00:42:34,246 --> 00:42:37,845
They even removed the hidden
passages Gürbüz talked about.

412
00:42:38,046 --> 00:42:40,885
Detecting the new ones
will take quite a time.

413
00:42:40,886 --> 00:42:42,895
Even those passages are defended...

414
00:42:42,970 --> 00:42:47,930
by soldiers with human-sized
shields who came from Byzantium.

415
00:42:51,966 --> 00:42:54,405
We can deal with the shields.

416
00:42:56,686 --> 00:42:59,645
Everything is clear now.

417
00:43:00,766 --> 00:43:03,605
We will go to Köprühisar.

418
00:43:05,246 --> 00:43:09,845
The toughest one is Köprühisar
among these places my Bey.

419
00:43:10,166 --> 00:43:14,525
How do we get through the shields when
it's impossible find the passages?

420
00:43:14,606 --> 00:43:17,005
I would like to know why.

421
00:43:17,326 --> 00:43:18,765
First,

422
00:43:19,726 --> 00:43:21,925
Köprühisar will open...

423
00:43:22,366 --> 00:43:25,765
the gate of whole conquest, the gates
of Bursa and İznik.

424
00:43:26,206 --> 00:43:29,965
Second, Köprühisar's key...

425
00:43:37,566 --> 00:43:39,845
is with us.

426
00:43:41,046 --> 00:43:43,245
What kind of key is this, my Bey?

427
00:43:50,406 --> 00:43:53,285
Every thing has a master.

428
00:43:53,676 --> 00:43:56,565
You will take this to the
person who built those passages.

429
00:43:56,646 --> 00:44:01,925
Give this to him. And he will give
you the map of passages.

430
00:44:06,366 --> 00:44:09,325
Who does that master serve, my Bey?
Who is he?

431
00:44:09,486 --> 00:44:12,125
- Can we trust him?
- Yes.

432
00:44:12,956 --> 00:44:14,755
We do.

433
00:44:15,406 --> 00:44:18,325
Don't worry. The ink is the
proof of everything.

434
00:44:19,646 --> 00:44:22,685
And he promised a favor to us.

435
00:44:23,366 --> 00:44:28,125
But... without the ink,
there will be no map.

436
00:44:28,486 --> 00:44:32,165
Without the map, there
won't be a conquest.

437
00:44:33,646 --> 00:44:37,765
You will bring the map to me until
the sunset tomorrow. Tell the Alps.

438
00:44:38,886 --> 00:44:42,565
- They should be ready for the war.
- Yes my Bey.

439
00:44:50,326 --> 00:44:53,245
You are thinking about
why we trust him,huh?

440
00:44:53,446 --> 00:44:55,485
Yes, my Bey.

441
00:44:56,046 --> 00:44:58,885
I took it from the
ones I consult...

442
00:44:59,646 --> 00:45:01,405
...when walking on our way.

443
00:45:04,526 --> 00:45:08,845
Now.. Tell the Alps.
They should take those shields.

444
00:45:10,006 --> 00:45:12,765
Yes, my Bey. If you allow me.

445
00:45:13,086 --> 00:45:14,805
Sure, you can go.

446
00:45:27,126 --> 00:45:29,965
Mashallah.
You did everything you said.

447
00:45:30,606 --> 00:45:34,165
You made Aktemur the Bey.
You took Marmaracık.

448
00:45:34,766 --> 00:45:38,565
You don't ever let me down, Bengi.

449
00:45:44,606 --> 00:45:46,765
Yes, Mother Sultan.

450
00:45:46,926 --> 00:45:51,565
I was not expecting this.
He turned out to be braver than I thought.

451
00:45:51,606 --> 00:45:52,965
Mashallah.

452
00:45:57,006 --> 00:45:59,525
Is he still not talking to his uncle Osman?

453
00:46:00,046 --> 00:46:04,725
He is not. There is no relation
left between him and Osman.

454
00:46:05,606 --> 00:46:08,085
If Osman is not behind him, I am behind him.

455
00:46:13,006 --> 00:46:17,005
The one who stands under the
shadow doesn't have a shadow.

456
00:46:17,646 --> 00:46:20,165
Aktemur did the right thing.

457
00:46:27,286 --> 00:46:31,965
We definitely need a bigger victory for
Aktemur to gain people's trust.

458
00:46:34,926 --> 00:46:38,245
We need more power for
big victories.

459
00:46:39,966 --> 00:46:42,885
We need your power Mother Sultan.

460
00:46:45,926 --> 00:46:48,885
- Mother Sultan.
- Tell me, Celali.

461
00:46:50,406 --> 00:46:54,845
Osman Bey sent news. He is inviting
you to iftar in his mansion.

462
00:46:55,686 --> 00:46:58,085
He also invited the Beys.

463
00:47:04,366 --> 00:47:07,005
Since he has gotten rid of Nayman...

464
00:47:07,246 --> 00:47:10,365
he is trying to show off now.

465
00:47:11,246 --> 00:47:13,565
He is still breathing.

466
00:47:14,406 --> 00:47:16,325
This is not justice.

467
00:47:16,606 --> 00:47:20,245
That is Osman's justice, Bengi Hatun.

468
00:47:24,766 --> 00:47:29,365
Celali. Prepare good gifts for Beys.

469
00:47:30,366 --> 00:47:34,805
We must remind them that
we have the power...

470
00:47:35,526 --> 00:47:37,765
and their leashes.

471
00:47:53,446 --> 00:47:56,045
My Sultan, you brought pleasure.

472
00:47:56,366 --> 00:47:58,885
I found pleasure here, Aktemur Bey.

473
00:48:04,566 --> 00:48:08,645
Come on, get ready.
You will also come to Yenişehir.

474
00:48:12,686 --> 00:48:16,365
- My Sultan, my uncle and I...
- I know.

475
00:48:18,086 --> 00:48:20,405
You are on bad terms with your uncle.

476
00:48:22,326 --> 00:48:27,485
But I won't let anyone be mad
at each other under my command.

477
00:48:36,926 --> 00:48:39,885
Come on.
We have to leave.

478
00:49:23,046 --> 00:49:27,405
The sun of Seljuks...

479
00:49:27,846 --> 00:49:31,085
Mighty Mother Sultan...

480
00:49:31,566 --> 00:49:33,765
spared my life.

481
00:49:35,686 --> 00:49:38,485
She wants loyalty in return.

482
00:49:40,046 --> 00:49:42,285
Loyalty.

483
00:49:42,966 --> 00:49:44,805
However,

484
00:49:45,646 --> 00:49:50,285
she's the one who's not loyal.

485
00:49:51,966 --> 00:49:54,045
What do you have on your mind, my Bey?

486
00:49:54,566 --> 00:49:58,045
Do we have a trick against Ismihan Sultan?

487
00:50:01,006 --> 00:50:03,805
Do I have the power to
make tricks Huseyin?

488
00:50:07,766 --> 00:50:09,925
It's not a trick.

489
00:50:12,726 --> 00:50:15,685
But I will protect myself.

490
00:50:16,366 --> 00:50:18,085
I have to.

491
00:50:18,966 --> 00:50:23,685
I'll do everything Valide Sultan requests...

492
00:50:25,686 --> 00:50:28,725
but as long as I have benefit.

493
00:50:30,766 --> 00:50:33,925
It's enough Huseyin.
It's enough.

494
00:50:35,366 --> 00:50:38,165
One of them wants to tie my
neck with rope...

495
00:50:39,766 --> 00:50:42,845
and one of them wants to
lock me with chains.

496
00:50:45,686 --> 00:50:49,085
I want freedom Huseyin.

497
00:51:20,046 --> 00:51:22,205
In this blessed day...

498
00:51:22,446 --> 00:51:24,805
welcome to our table.

499
00:51:25,126 --> 00:51:27,405
Thank you, my Bey.

500
00:51:29,646 --> 00:51:31,845
In this mubarak Ramadan,

501
00:51:32,046 --> 00:51:37,485
we offer gratitude to our Allah
who gathered us at one table.

502
00:51:37,926 --> 00:51:39,805
- Amin.
- Amin, my Sheikh.

503
00:51:40,166 --> 00:51:45,125
I pray that we can let go of Ramadan in a
way that is pleased with us.

504
00:51:46,006 --> 00:51:49,245
We should always remember
that we are brothers.

505
00:51:49,766 --> 00:51:52,845
Let's try to live together and in peace.

506
00:51:53,166 --> 00:51:56,005
Let's hold onto Allah together.

507
00:51:56,286 --> 00:51:58,085
Amin.

508
00:51:59,446 --> 00:52:04,045
May Ramadan...

509
00:52:04,486 --> 00:52:08,645
- be of help in this purpose, Inshallah.
- Amin.

510
00:52:11,006 --> 00:52:14,205
My dear people, Muslims
are brothers.

511
00:52:14,726 --> 00:52:19,325
The brotherhood of Muslims
is a shield against infidels.

512
00:52:20,086 --> 00:52:22,645
The stronger our brotherhood is...

513
00:52:23,126 --> 00:52:26,045
the more solid our shield will be.

514
00:52:27,326 --> 00:52:32,405
May my Allah make us one of those who
follow His path constantly, Inshallah.

515
00:52:32,566 --> 00:52:33,925
Amin.

516
00:52:34,086 --> 00:52:37,405
Amin, my Sheikh. Amin.

517
00:52:38,246 --> 00:52:40,005
Thanks to my Allah...

518
00:52:40,606 --> 00:52:43,285
thanks to the blessings He
bestowed upon us.

519
00:52:43,526 --> 00:52:47,125
Thanks for our health, and...

520
00:52:47,486 --> 00:52:50,445
thanks for our struggle to keep
following His path.

521
00:52:50,646 --> 00:52:53,205
- Amin.
- Amin.

522
00:54:00,446 --> 00:54:03,325
There is no deity but Allah.

523
00:54:18,006 --> 00:54:19,885
Let's go.

524
00:54:20,246 --> 00:54:23,365
May Allah accept your fasting.
Enjoy your meal.

525
00:54:23,846 --> 00:54:27,085
In the name of Allah, the merciful
and compassionate.

526
00:54:27,246 --> 00:54:29,725
May Allah accept your fasting.

527
00:54:31,526 --> 00:54:35,195
In the name of Allah, the merciful
and compassionate.

528
00:55:11,446 --> 00:55:14,125
In the name of Allah, the merciful
and compassionate.

529
00:55:34,166 --> 00:55:35,805
Hancı.

530
00:55:36,606 --> 00:55:40,885
Give Nayman food. He'll live
until we arrive in Tabriz.

531
00:55:43,406 --> 00:55:47,245
He will not die until he pays
the price for his betrayal!

532
00:55:54,126 --> 00:55:59,165
Gazan Khan...

533
00:55:59,686 --> 00:56:02,205
will pay the price for
the betrayal, not me.

534
00:56:03,846 --> 00:56:07,805
The dream you believed in
has blinded you.

535
00:56:08,966 --> 00:56:11,805
Why would Gazan Khan pay the price?

536
00:56:12,446 --> 00:56:16,205
You'll be drowned
in Erlik Khan's wrath.

537
00:56:36,166 --> 00:56:39,805
You should be afraid of Allah's wrath.

538
00:56:41,206 --> 00:56:43,125
The bad things you did...

539
00:56:43,566 --> 00:56:47,085
You used the power you
got for evilness.

540
00:56:48,286 --> 00:56:52,245
But we arrived just in time and
protected the seal from you.

541
00:56:52,486 --> 00:56:56,205
Otherwise, what would happen
to these lands?

542
00:57:02,806 --> 00:57:07,685
Osman Bey, me and the
Beys are thankful for your invitation.

543
00:57:08,406 --> 00:57:12,805
We sent the intruder Nayman
from these lands.

544
00:57:15,766 --> 00:57:19,565
I know that Beys are aware of our...

545
00:57:20,286 --> 00:57:22,045
common quest.

546
00:57:24,726 --> 00:57:28,405
Yes, Mother Sultan. Thank you.

547
00:57:30,046 --> 00:57:32,365
Without your help...

548
00:57:33,886 --> 00:57:36,685
there would be no victory.

549
00:57:37,566 --> 00:57:39,365
May you all live long.

550
00:57:40,206 --> 00:57:41,645
But my Bey...

551
00:57:42,326 --> 00:57:47,285
If Mother Sultan wouldn't object at
the beginning, it wouldn't be this hard.

552
00:57:52,326 --> 00:57:55,165
Sometimes differences
might happen, Beys.

553
00:57:55,606 --> 00:57:58,845
We focus on the result.

554
00:57:59,886 --> 00:58:03,245
Victory is our gift from our union.

555
00:58:08,486 --> 00:58:10,285
Celali.

556
00:58:20,846 --> 00:58:24,765
These are my gifts to you.

557
00:59:01,646 --> 00:59:04,205
But of course the biggest gift is...

558
00:59:04,686 --> 00:59:07,285
to reconcile the offended uncle...

559
00:59:08,406 --> 00:59:11,485
with his nephew.

560
00:59:17,646 --> 00:59:20,245
The issues in family are always solved.

561
00:59:23,526 --> 00:59:26,525
There is no issue between
me and my nephew.

562
00:59:28,406 --> 00:59:30,285
Tell me, nephew.

563
00:59:31,446 --> 00:59:33,725
That is true uncle.

564
00:59:35,766 --> 00:59:39,405
Yes, son.

565
00:59:48,486 --> 00:59:49,725
Celali.

566
00:59:51,726 --> 00:59:55,085
Osman Bey, this is a sword used by
Seljuks...

567
00:59:55,166 --> 00:59:59,765
commanders who won a great victory.

568
01:00:22,726 --> 01:00:27,725
Its argil was mixed with
silver and its back is sharp.

569
01:00:49,606 --> 01:00:52,005
That's what good for Osman Bey.

570
01:00:53,126 --> 01:00:58,485
Sharped back. Otherwise, there are a lot of people
who want to attack him from behind.

571
01:00:59,326 --> 01:01:02,605
Osman Bey's justice sword
is enough for him.

572
01:01:03,006 --> 01:01:06,525
There is no need for this,
Mother Sultan.

573
01:01:09,686 --> 01:01:13,245
Osman Bey only needs union.

574
01:01:14,486 --> 01:01:18,445
But if we keep arguing all the time...

575
01:01:19,286 --> 01:01:22,845
it won't be good for anyone.

576
01:01:26,326 --> 01:01:29,325
Turgut Bey is right.

577
01:01:30,166 --> 01:01:34,325
Victories come only with our unity...

578
01:01:35,766 --> 01:01:38,005
and with the permission of my Allah.

579
01:01:39,686 --> 01:01:41,925
Those who want to do
something bad...

580
01:01:42,486 --> 01:01:45,125
will only benefit the enemy.

581
01:01:48,566 --> 01:01:53,605
That's what we are saying my Bey.
We all unite after you.

582
01:01:55,886 --> 01:02:00,405
- There is no need for duality.
- Thank you.

583
01:02:02,966 --> 01:02:08,045
My Bey. We made a decision
with Beys.

584
01:02:09,686 --> 01:02:11,445
Tell me.

585
01:02:11,766 --> 01:02:15,125
As border Beys, we...

586
01:02:15,766 --> 01:02:19,245
won't pay our taxes to the Seljuk...

587
01:02:21,686 --> 01:02:23,885
..but to you.

588
01:02:24,446 --> 01:02:28,645
When infidels come, you fight with them.
When they cause bad things, you solve it.

589
01:02:29,966 --> 01:02:32,805
You even ended the disorder in Konya.

590
01:02:33,326 --> 01:02:36,085
You are stopping the traitors there.

591
01:02:41,206 --> 01:02:45,165
I want to pay my tax to Kayı
tribe, Osman Bey.

592
01:02:47,646 --> 01:02:49,885
We, as Beys and the folks...

593
01:02:50,406 --> 01:02:54,085
want to give our gold to the
one who helps us the most.

594
01:02:54,406 --> 01:02:57,205
Mother Sultan should not be offended.

595
01:02:57,726 --> 01:03:01,205
Time changes.
We should also change.

596
01:03:04,326 --> 01:03:06,125
Beys.

597
01:03:07,246 --> 01:03:11,085
I listened to you
without interrupting you.

598
01:03:12,646 --> 01:03:17,205
I wanted to see the limits
of your rebelliousness.

599
01:03:19,006 --> 01:03:21,085
Pull yourself together...

600
01:03:22,446 --> 01:03:25,165
...or I will make you
pay for it dearly.

601
01:03:25,406 --> 01:03:28,485
No, Mother Sultan.

602
01:03:30,006 --> 01:03:32,085
Stop there.

603
01:03:33,086 --> 01:03:35,565
Perhaps Beys tell the truth.

604
01:03:36,486 --> 01:03:38,525
Let's hear them first.

605
01:03:53,686 --> 01:03:57,605
Sharpen it.
Sharpen it well, Bagatur.

606
01:03:59,206 --> 01:04:02,725
I will kill you with your sword.

607
01:04:05,566 --> 01:04:09,205
You are taking
your power from the seal, Bagatur.

608
01:04:09,486 --> 01:04:11,445
To whom does the seal belong?

609
01:04:12,446 --> 01:04:16,365
The seal belongs to Genghis Khan, Nayman.

610
01:04:19,086 --> 01:04:22,205
Genghis Khan was not a Muslim.

611
01:04:23,926 --> 01:04:28,685
It's a matter of state.
We are protecting the seal from you.

612
01:04:35,646 --> 01:04:38,765
They went to Genghis.

613
01:04:40,166 --> 01:04:44,845
They invited him to Islam.
He always rejected.

614
01:04:47,726 --> 01:04:52,445
You are traitors, the ones
who embraced what Genghis rejected.

615
01:04:53,686 --> 01:04:56,165
Gazan and you..

616
01:04:56,806 --> 01:05:00,725
That seal can only be stained
in the hands of a Muslim.

617
01:05:01,166 --> 01:05:04,445
That seal is only valuable
when in the hands of a man...

618
01:05:04,806 --> 01:05:07,605
...who is blessed by
Sky Tengri (Turkish-Mongolian God)

619
01:05:08,486 --> 01:05:12,285
You dirt Genghis' inheritance, Bagatur.

620
01:05:12,886 --> 01:05:15,805
You betray him.

621
01:05:17,846 --> 01:05:21,125
The seal belongs to the dynasty, Nayman.

622
01:05:21,526 --> 01:05:25,325
It belongs to the state.
You and your brother Talay...

623
01:05:25,766 --> 01:05:30,365
...stole it for your bloody games.
You have no rights on it.

624
01:05:30,726 --> 01:05:34,965
The seal will go to the place
it belongs, to Tabriz, Nayman.

625
01:05:36,126 --> 01:05:40,165
The seal belongs to the ones
who do not betray Genghis.

626
01:05:42,886 --> 01:05:45,805
The seal belongs to me, Bagatur.

627
01:05:46,366 --> 01:05:49,885
You will have been dead
once you understand this.

628
01:05:50,286 --> 01:05:55,405
I will avenge Talay
and take the seal from you.

629
01:05:55,806 --> 01:05:58,245
You will die, Bagatur.

630
01:06:08,166 --> 01:06:12,805
Commander Bagatur.
Nayman is trying to deceive the soldiers.

631
01:06:13,526 --> 01:06:17,685
He wants to cause a disorder
and get away.

632
01:06:18,766 --> 01:06:23,645
Right. I know. Don't worry.

633
01:06:44,406 --> 01:06:46,845
Thank you, thank you.

634
01:06:47,526 --> 01:06:51,245
You honored me, made me proud.

635
01:06:57,926 --> 01:07:02,085
Certainly, the Seljuk State...

636
01:07:02,566 --> 01:07:05,085
...has been going through
difficult times.

637
01:07:11,046 --> 01:07:13,685
But you are right.

638
01:07:15,326 --> 01:07:18,285
While we protect our homeland...

639
01:07:18,566 --> 01:07:23,085
...we should definitely taste...

640
01:07:23,526 --> 01:07:26,205
...power and wealth as well.

641
01:07:37,006 --> 01:07:39,605
But I don't want to ignore...

642
01:07:40,246 --> 01:07:42,045
...Mother Sultan's efforts.

643
01:07:42,446 --> 01:07:46,405
Mother Sultan, you thought
your Bey was a great commander.

644
01:07:49,806 --> 01:07:52,085
You gave him a sword.

645
01:07:52,846 --> 01:07:55,365
And you shared his victory.

646
01:07:56,606 --> 01:08:00,045
So you will give him the half of the taxes.

647
01:08:08,246 --> 01:08:10,485
We shared the hardships.

648
01:08:12,206 --> 01:08:16,404
So there's nothing wrong to
share the power, Osman Bey.

649
01:08:16,886 --> 01:08:19,205
Alright.

650
01:08:25,406 --> 01:08:27,564
Alaaddin Bey.

651
01:08:30,526 --> 01:08:32,564
Write it down.

652
01:09:02,086 --> 01:09:04,604
Osman Bey's law.

653
01:09:11,486 --> 01:09:13,365
The beylics around..

654
01:09:13,725 --> 01:09:18,245
...will pay the half of the tax
they pay to Seljuks...

655
01:09:21,326 --> 01:09:23,645
...to Kayi Tribe...

656
01:09:24,886 --> 01:09:28,365
..from Shawwal Month.
(tenth month of the lunar based Islamic calendar)

657
01:09:34,206 --> 01:09:36,325
Mother Sultan.

658
01:09:36,845 --> 01:09:41,885
We can advance only
by sharing like this. Thank you.

659
01:09:55,846 --> 01:10:00,165
Wolves caught the Seljuk State
among them.

660
01:10:02,006 --> 01:10:04,085
...and they're sharing us.

661
01:10:05,246 --> 01:10:09,165
They're also having iftaar dinner with us.

662
01:10:12,886 --> 01:10:15,245
Thank you, Osman Bey.

663
01:10:20,606 --> 01:10:22,885
Thank you, Beys.

664
01:10:29,526 --> 01:10:31,805
Mother Sultan.

665
01:10:35,566 --> 01:10:38,965
Wait a little, wait.

666
01:10:40,886 --> 01:10:43,645
You think you're degraded here.

667
01:10:44,326 --> 01:10:46,325
The sharing wolves die, of course.

668
01:10:46,606 --> 01:10:50,485
But nobody here has such an intention.

669
01:10:53,006 --> 01:10:57,165
Please. Join our alliance.

670
01:10:58,966 --> 01:11:03,045
I said thank you
Osman Bey.

671
01:11:04,406 --> 01:11:06,685
Stay safe.

672
01:11:08,846 --> 01:11:11,125
Stay safe.

673
01:11:11,526 --> 01:11:13,925
Stay safe, Mother Sultan.

674
01:11:18,006 --> 01:11:21,685
Stay safe, Beys.

675
01:11:46,686 --> 01:11:50,245
What is this weapon for, brothers?

676
01:11:53,806 --> 01:11:56,925
My Bey must have a plan for it, brother.

677
01:12:07,006 --> 01:12:12,565
It's a little different from the
spearhead we know, huh?

678
01:12:14,966 --> 01:12:18,965
Come on, brothers.
Let's finish this before the sahoor.

679
01:12:19,246 --> 01:12:21,525
We need to produce many more.

680
01:12:24,086 --> 01:12:26,165
Come on.

681
01:12:35,366 --> 01:12:37,445
-Brother.
-Yes?

682
01:12:37,886 --> 01:12:42,645
I've been fasting for days
without eating at sahoor, brother.

683
01:12:42,926 --> 01:12:46,885
-Oh no.
-What can we do about that?

684
01:12:54,446 --> 01:12:56,725
I know.

685
01:12:57,646 --> 01:13:00,165
-I know.
-What?

686
01:13:00,246 --> 01:13:04,525
-Will you find a solution for sahoor?
-I've already found, brother.

687
01:13:04,806 --> 01:13:07,765
You'll see, Gurbuz.

688
01:13:13,566 --> 01:13:16,525
Brothers.
This Cerkutay...

689
01:13:16,806 --> 01:13:19,645
Is he really lunatic?

690
01:13:34,166 --> 01:13:37,685
Brothers, I will play drum
at sahoors from now on.

691
01:13:37,806 --> 01:13:41,045
So there will be no one
who can't wake up for sahoor.

692
01:13:54,526 --> 01:13:58,925
But playing drum is not enough.
We also need to sing.

693
01:14:05,646 --> 01:14:09,645
Wake up at sahoor and do good deeds!

694
01:14:13,686 --> 01:14:17,885
You can't do good by sleeping!

695
01:14:21,526 --> 01:14:25,365
The lazy sleep and do nothing!

696
01:14:29,686 --> 01:14:33,405
Cerkutay won't let you sleep!

697
01:14:41,886 --> 01:14:45,485
-What are you doing here?
-I knew this would work!

698
01:14:49,366 --> 01:14:50,525
-Aykurt.
-Yes brother.

699
01:14:50,526 --> 01:14:53,205
From now on,
alps will play drums at sahoor time.

700
01:14:53,326 --> 01:14:57,085
and everyone will be able to wake up for sahoor!

701
01:14:59,246 --> 01:15:02,805
I'll beat you Cerkutay, come here!

702
01:15:09,246 --> 01:15:12,005
Any news from Karavul, Celali?

703
01:15:12,726 --> 01:15:14,645
He's watching step by step.

704
01:15:14,966 --> 01:15:18,365
They will spend the night in
the caravanserai in Karakuyu.

705
01:15:18,766 --> 01:15:21,645
They will depart in the morning.

706
01:15:22,046 --> 01:15:26,245
What is the shortest way that goes
Tebriz from Karakuyu, Celali?

707
01:15:26,366 --> 01:15:28,885
Kirtca path, Mother Sultan.

708
01:15:35,926 --> 01:15:37,845
Osman!

709
01:15:38,686 --> 01:15:42,285
You will pay for
boasting against Mother Sultan,

710
01:15:43,046 --> 01:15:45,525
and you will see the...

711
01:15:45,846 --> 01:15:49,645
...results of being impertinent.

712
01:15:52,526 --> 01:15:54,885
He thinks he has won now.

713
01:15:55,646 --> 01:15:59,445
He thinks he has the power.

714
01:16:02,806 --> 01:16:07,205
Osman will lose everything he has, Celali.

715
01:16:12,606 --> 01:16:17,325
Such people get rich
when there is no enemy around.

716
01:16:23,726 --> 01:16:28,565
Get the most competent warriors
and best archers ready.

717
01:16:31,726 --> 01:16:33,965
Let Bayindir know.

718
01:16:38,366 --> 01:16:42,725
We will save Nayman,
we will take the seal.

719
01:16:44,966 --> 01:16:47,325
Yes, Mother Sultan.

720
01:16:56,086 --> 01:16:57,685
Alps!

721
01:16:59,406 --> 01:17:01,685
Our new aim...

722
01:17:02,606 --> 01:17:06,565
that we will advance to conquer is Kopruhisar.

723
01:17:10,886 --> 01:17:12,725
We heard that...

724
01:17:13,126 --> 01:17:16,245
Kopruhisar took the greatest precautions.

725
01:17:17,286 --> 01:17:22,085
In fact, they brought huge shields
from Constantinople.

726
01:17:23,526 --> 01:17:27,365
Even if we enter, they will build
a shield wall against us.

727
01:17:29,166 --> 01:17:31,205
If that's the case...

728
01:17:32,486 --> 01:17:34,165
...let's see.

729
01:17:34,606 --> 01:17:38,685
Cerkutay. Baysungur. Bring it.

730
01:18:31,246 --> 01:18:34,125
Alps. Here!

731
01:18:36,846 --> 01:18:41,325
These are the shields
they claim to be impassable.

732
01:18:44,486 --> 01:18:46,365
Cerkutay!

733
01:19:04,166 --> 01:19:05,565
Alps!

734
01:19:06,366 --> 01:19:10,605
Here, look at it carefully, Alps.

735
01:19:11,886 --> 01:19:14,365
The thing that will pass through
these shields...

736
01:19:15,086 --> 01:19:16,885
...is this spear.

737
01:19:33,326 --> 01:19:35,685
Now that these shields
cannot be passed...

738
01:19:37,606 --> 01:19:40,325
...then we will show
you how to pass through them.

739
01:19:40,646 --> 01:19:42,565
Stay strong.

740
01:20:19,326 --> 01:20:20,925
Stand up, come on.

741
01:20:33,526 --> 01:20:36,005
The soldiers with these shields will be...

742
01:20:36,366 --> 01:20:39,085
...on the eastern side of Kopruhisar.

743
01:20:39,486 --> 01:20:43,365
Those who fight there,
the alps who is assigned to fight there...

744
01:20:43,566 --> 01:20:46,565
...will practice this spears.

745
01:20:47,006 --> 01:20:49,445
I don't want a single mistake, alright?

746
01:20:49,726 --> 01:20:51,805
Yes my Bey.

747
01:20:56,606 --> 01:21:00,085
Baysungur. Cerkutay

748
01:21:11,886 --> 01:21:14,285
You heard the commands of attack.

749
01:21:14,966 --> 01:21:17,045
Now let me command for defence.

750
01:21:17,846 --> 01:21:22,085
The Alps who will fight against
the Mongolian cavalry in the forest...

751
01:21:23,286 --> 01:21:26,085
...you will equip this spear as well.

752
01:21:26,486 --> 01:21:30,565
Now we're going to clamp
these spears together.

753
01:21:31,806 --> 01:21:35,885
If strong valiants hold these spears...

754
01:21:36,766 --> 01:21:40,445
...they will never be broken
knocking ten cavalries.

755
01:21:42,366 --> 01:21:43,725
Come on, valiants.

756
01:21:47,326 --> 01:21:50,005
In the name of Allah,
the Compassionate, the Merciful.

757
01:21:50,886 --> 01:21:53,645
Allah is eternal!

758
01:22:03,166 --> 01:22:06,405
Thank you, valiants.
Thank you.

759
01:22:07,326 --> 01:22:11,605
Thanks.
That is all, alps. That is all.

760
01:22:16,886 --> 01:22:21,485
My Bey. Do we need to train against
Mongols since Nayman left?

761
01:22:22,446 --> 01:22:26,085
No.
One leaves..

762
01:22:26,926 --> 01:22:28,445
..but a thousand comes.

763
01:22:29,486 --> 01:22:32,965
These lands will never be left alone
by the enemies.

764
01:22:33,486 --> 01:22:35,365
Right.

765
01:23:08,526 --> 01:23:10,885
The road is safe, Commander Bagatur.

766
01:23:11,126 --> 01:23:16,365
Good. Stay on alert. Send some of the troops
on the right, some on the left.

767
01:23:16,766 --> 01:23:19,765
All of you shall be careful.

768
01:23:22,726 --> 01:23:26,645
No precaution will protect you
from me, Bagatur.

769
01:23:27,526 --> 01:23:30,125
I will kill you with my bare hands!

770
01:23:30,766 --> 01:23:35,805
We have a long way, Nayman.
Do not spend your power by talking.

771
01:23:45,446 --> 01:23:46,965
Come on.

772
01:24:06,406 --> 01:24:08,805
Where is Karavul already, Celali?

773
01:24:09,886 --> 01:24:14,485
Perhaps he got caught, Mother Sultan.
Should I send a scout to the caravansary?

774
01:24:15,206 --> 01:24:18,245
No. Don't you do that.

775
01:24:19,286 --> 01:24:21,525
We will wait.

776
01:24:21,766 --> 01:24:26,965
We will not scare them.
Or else, we cannot take Nayman from them.

777
01:24:35,606 --> 01:24:37,725
He is coming, Mother Sultan.

778
01:24:49,726 --> 01:24:54,885
My Mother Sultan.
The caravan left the caravansary.

779
01:24:55,206 --> 01:24:58,805
They proceed to Tabriz on an
old path to the Kirca route.

780
01:24:59,486 --> 01:25:01,045
Good.

781
01:25:02,446 --> 01:25:06,965
We will first catch them on the way
then we will cut their breaths.

782
01:25:08,166 --> 01:25:12,045
The frontiers did not choose
to be enlightened with my light.

783
01:25:12,486 --> 01:25:15,765
Then Nayman will be freed.

784
01:25:16,606 --> 01:25:19,445
He will bring the darkness for rebels.

785
01:25:21,766 --> 01:25:26,965
Now listen to me carefully about
how we are going to save Nayman.

786
01:25:33,646 --> 01:25:37,685
If Nayman goes then someone
else will come.

787
01:25:39,366 --> 01:25:43,445
Our lands are always in fire circle.

788
01:25:44,006 --> 01:25:47,725
The east is surrounded
the west is hard.

789
01:25:48,326 --> 01:25:51,365
That's why we will always be in training!

790
01:25:51,486 --> 01:25:54,325
-As you say my Bey!
-Good.

791
01:25:57,446 --> 01:26:01,085
Turgut Bey, let's train with you...

792
01:26:01,726 --> 01:26:05,485
-so the alps enjoy it.
-It's an honor Osman Bey.

793
01:27:14,086 --> 01:27:16,245
This is how you
took care of Talay?

794
01:27:16,766 --> 01:27:20,485
I learned how to cheat from the infidels.

795
01:27:38,046 --> 01:27:40,205
But I am not Talay.

796
01:27:43,486 --> 01:27:45,205
Come here.

797
01:27:47,286 --> 01:27:48,565
Well played.

798
01:27:49,086 --> 01:27:51,285
-Well played, my Brave.
-May you live long.

799
01:27:51,646 --> 01:27:57,245
Alps! As you see, you will
always be in training.

800
01:27:57,686 --> 01:28:01,605
But you'll be careful
against the cheaters.

801
01:28:12,446 --> 01:28:14,685
Now everyone,
get back to their training.

802
01:28:21,576 --> 01:28:24,845
The infiltration plan will fail
if Konur does not arrive.

803
01:28:24,846 --> 01:28:29,925
Don't worry. He has never left
any of his duty unfinished.

804
01:28:32,086 --> 01:28:35,645
You go to headquarters.
Check the trainings.

805
01:28:35,926 --> 01:28:37,125
As you say.

806
01:28:37,646 --> 01:28:42,365
When Konur gives the ink and brings the map,
it means the Kopruhisar is ours.

807
01:28:42,846 --> 01:28:44,885
If Allah permits.

808
01:28:46,686 --> 01:28:49,925
-May your path be open.
-Thank you Osman Bey.

809
01:28:50,726 --> 01:28:52,485
Come on Alps!

810
01:29:20,086 --> 01:29:24,325
My loyal soldiers will not leave me alone.

811
01:29:25,726 --> 01:29:29,725
Soldiers! We won't go back without
saving the Almighty Commander Nayman.

812
01:29:52,406 --> 01:29:53,885
Come on!

813
01:30:01,406 --> 01:30:05,405
Traces indicate that
Commander Nayman went this way.

814
01:30:09,326 --> 01:30:10,765
Come on

815
01:30:24,646 --> 01:30:26,565
Be careful.

816
01:31:15,926 --> 01:31:20,645
Help us! Please help us!
My horse is wounded, please!

817
01:31:36,086 --> 01:31:38,245
Let's continue
Commander Bagatur.

818
01:31:44,006 --> 01:31:47,365
Horses are the best friends of Mongols.

819
01:31:47,966 --> 01:31:50,245
We won't turn our backs.

820
01:31:52,766 --> 01:31:55,005
Soldiers. Check it.

821
01:32:08,726 --> 01:32:09,925
Attack!

822
01:33:40,966 --> 01:33:45,645
I bear witness that there is no God but Allah,

823
01:33:45,766 --> 01:33:49,725
and I bear witness that Muhammad is the Messenger...

824
01:34:19,486 --> 01:34:21,405
No.

825
01:34:26,566 --> 01:34:29,445
No. Nayman.

826
01:34:31,686 --> 01:34:37,685
The seal is yours. But you'll give
me what belongs to me first.

827
01:34:40,486 --> 01:34:42,565
What do you want, Ismihan?

828
01:34:42,646 --> 01:34:45,805
Everything in these lands.

829
01:34:57,166 --> 01:34:59,325
May your fight be holy, my Bey.

830
01:35:01,086 --> 01:35:04,165
Thank you, Bala. Thank you.

831
01:35:10,806 --> 01:35:12,685
Osman.

832
01:35:14,886 --> 01:35:19,005
I know this isn't a good time,
but I have something in my mind.

833
01:35:19,166 --> 01:35:21,725
I'll start if you allow.

834
01:35:22,286 --> 01:35:24,965
Tell me, Bala. I'm all ears.

835
01:35:25,966 --> 01:35:30,125
As your reputation spreads,
Turkmens flow to our tribe.

836
01:35:30,966 --> 01:35:33,845
Many have migrated
to Yenisehir recently.

837
01:35:33,926 --> 01:35:36,965
We have many guests and new comers.

838
01:35:38,246 --> 01:35:42,085
I've been thinking...
If we build an almshouse...

839
01:35:42,326 --> 01:35:44,565
...with food available all the time,

840
01:35:44,926 --> 01:35:47,965
...we can help the passengers
and the poor, huh?

841
01:35:48,206 --> 01:35:51,765
Well-thought, Bala.
Really well-thought.

842
01:35:52,126 --> 01:35:55,485
You always back me up. Thank you.

843
01:35:55,686 --> 01:35:59,885
Sure. We should act quickly
for good deeds.

844
01:36:00,326 --> 01:36:03,725
We should be prepared, anyway.
There will be many more comers.

845
01:36:03,966 --> 01:36:07,245
-We should be careful.
-Right, right.

846
01:36:07,486 --> 01:36:11,885
-Thank you, my Bey. May Allah be pleased with you.
-With you too.

847
01:36:13,366 --> 01:36:17,325
Take care of our sons.
Give me your blessings.

848
01:36:18,606 --> 01:36:23,925
You have mine, my Bey. I'll take a good
care of them. May Allah open your way.

849
01:37:16,206 --> 01:37:18,725
Are you lost, foreigner?

850
01:37:19,366 --> 01:37:23,285
This land is dangerous.
You may get in trouble at any time.

851
01:37:24,486 --> 01:37:30,125
So you should give your precious items.
Otherwise, they'll take your life.

852
01:37:32,606 --> 01:37:37,325
I have no precious things. But I'm strong
enough to kill whoever tries to kill me.

853
01:37:38,286 --> 01:37:40,285
Enough!

854
01:37:43,126 --> 01:37:47,085
Innocent people have been
suffering because of bandits like you.

855
01:37:47,086 --> 01:37:50,485
Now it's your turn.

856
01:38:16,046 --> 01:38:17,725
It worths a good deal.

857
01:38:19,526 --> 01:38:23,205
We got what we wanted. Let's go.

858
01:38:40,486 --> 01:38:42,685
Attention!

859
01:38:57,886 --> 01:38:59,525
Come on!

860
01:39:00,806 --> 01:39:04,005
-May your fight be holy, my Bey!
-Thank you.

861
01:39:04,006 --> 01:39:06,725
May Allah help you!

862
01:39:20,406 --> 01:39:22,405
Alcicek.

863
01:39:23,086 --> 01:39:26,725
Aktemur has made peace with his uncle.

864
01:39:27,806 --> 01:39:29,725
I'm so happy about that.

865
01:39:32,406 --> 01:39:36,565
Yes, mother. They are in
good terms, thanks to Allah.

866
01:39:37,126 --> 01:39:38,845
Yes.

867
01:39:42,566 --> 01:39:45,285
But I don't understand.

868
01:39:47,126 --> 01:39:52,045
If Osman Bey was going
to forgive him so easily...

869
01:39:52,966 --> 01:39:56,085
Why did he kick
Aktemur out of the assembly?

870
01:39:57,926 --> 01:39:59,525
No idea.

871
01:40:00,246 --> 01:40:03,125
Maybe, Mother Ayse
talked to Osman Bey.

872
01:40:10,686 --> 01:40:14,405
-Good day, bride!
-Thank you.

873
01:40:15,966 --> 01:40:19,085
What's it?
Where are you going?

874
01:40:20,006 --> 01:40:23,845
Well, Bengi Hatun...
We're going for a good thing.

875
01:40:24,086 --> 01:40:27,405
With Allah's will, we will build an
almshouse in Yenisehir.

876
01:40:27,566 --> 01:40:29,885
So we're going to look for a place for it.

877
01:40:30,046 --> 01:40:33,485
Praise you!
You never stop for a break.

878
01:40:34,526 --> 01:40:36,445
Thank you.

879
01:40:36,846 --> 01:40:42,005
Bride, join us at iftaar today.
Aktemur isn't here, anyway.

880
01:40:42,206 --> 01:40:45,685
So we can have iftaar
woman-to-woman all together, huh?

881
01:40:47,806 --> 01:40:49,965
We will.

882
01:40:50,166 --> 01:40:52,605
Good idea. Thanks.

883
01:40:53,366 --> 01:40:57,285
See you at dinner then.
Good luck.

884
01:41:05,406 --> 01:41:08,605
Listen to me carefully now, Alcicek.

885
01:41:09,166 --> 01:41:11,645
I'll talk to Bala...

886
01:41:12,246 --> 01:41:14,885
...and get involved in this almshouse thing.

887
01:41:15,606 --> 01:41:19,325
-And what will I do, mother?
-You will win people's favor.

888
01:41:20,326 --> 01:41:25,605
As your husband conquered Marmaracik,
you'll conquer people's hearts.

889
01:41:25,726 --> 01:41:29,525
Being a Bey isn't only about conquering.
There are things you should do too.

890
01:41:35,046 --> 01:41:37,085
Alcicek.

891
01:41:37,646 --> 01:41:42,125
Come on. We can't leave such
a big prey to them.

892
01:41:44,126 --> 01:41:46,565
If you want to do big things,

893
01:41:47,566 --> 01:41:49,925
...your move should be big too.

894
01:41:53,286 --> 01:41:54,685
Come on.

895
01:42:01,446 --> 01:42:05,125
Alcicek, be there with such a standing...

896
01:42:06,166 --> 01:42:09,325
...that everyone should think
you're the head of the charity.

897
01:42:11,446 --> 01:42:12,685
Come on.

898
01:42:27,206 --> 01:42:31,485
I saved your life with
only one condition, Nayman.

899
01:42:31,886 --> 01:42:33,845
You'll destroy Osman.

900
01:42:34,206 --> 01:42:38,685
You will step back from
Konya and frontiers.

901
01:42:40,966 --> 01:42:43,125
Everything will be mine.

902
01:42:45,206 --> 01:42:49,605
My life is more precious than
Konya and frontiers.

903
01:42:49,806 --> 01:42:52,125
You will give me the seal.

904
01:42:53,966 --> 01:42:56,925
The seal is useless in your hand.

905
01:42:58,326 --> 01:43:02,485
If I want the seal or your life,
I can take it now, Ismihan.

906
01:43:03,446 --> 01:43:07,605
And these lands will be mine,
why would I accept your offer?

907
01:43:07,766 --> 01:43:10,845
Nayman, I don't feel sorry
for killing anyone.

908
01:43:11,286 --> 01:43:15,925
...to take control of this land.

909
01:43:18,006 --> 01:43:21,565
But if we fight, we will lose our pwoer.

910
01:43:22,086 --> 01:43:24,805
And Osman will be
the one who is going to win.

911
01:43:26,526 --> 01:43:32,565
That's why we will unite
and destroy Osman.

912
01:43:33,966 --> 01:43:38,165
And we both will get what we want.

913
01:43:39,046 --> 01:43:42,725
Osman Bey will learn all of this!

914
01:44:03,086 --> 01:44:04,685
No!

915
01:44:26,566 --> 01:44:30,445
You did what you had to do Ismihan.

916
01:44:30,766 --> 01:44:34,205
And I'll do what you want
by killing Osman.

917
01:45:17,646 --> 01:45:22,685
Who can stand against this army Ismihan?

918
01:45:24,006 --> 01:45:26,285
We'll give what you want.

919
01:46:17,046 --> 01:46:22,405
I am halfway through my life, but I never
betrayed the entrustment. I won't.

920
01:46:24,166 --> 01:46:26,365
Now I'll be your curse.

921
01:47:10,006 --> 01:47:12,045
This was a good raid.

922
01:47:13,886 --> 01:47:15,805
It is very worthy.

923
01:47:17,326 --> 01:47:21,365
This is our territory,
everyone will know this.

924
01:47:21,886 --> 01:47:23,605
Yes.

925
01:47:55,286 --> 01:47:57,165
Ours.

926
01:48:13,126 --> 01:48:16,125
-It's a decent piece.
-Yes.

927
01:48:23,566 --> 01:48:26,845
Now you dropped the brick, bandits.

928
01:48:43,446 --> 01:48:46,725
-May it be easy, Agha.
-Thank you, Malhun Hatun.

929
01:48:47,206 --> 01:48:50,005
Do you have any shortcomings
or complaints?

930
01:48:50,566 --> 01:48:53,445
We don't, thank Allah,
Malhun Hatun.

931
01:48:54,286 --> 01:48:56,965
Tell her the truth!
Why are you keeping silent?

932
01:48:57,286 --> 01:48:59,445
Stay out of this!

933
01:49:00,166 --> 01:49:04,005
Malhun Hatun. Don't listen to them.
They just stay silent and sit still.

934
01:49:05,366 --> 01:49:07,325
What's it?
What wrong?

935
01:49:07,406 --> 01:49:10,605
Merchants from outside
sell everything dearly.

936
01:49:10,726 --> 01:49:14,685
They ask 5 coins
for a one-coin product.

937
01:49:16,206 --> 01:49:17,885
Why are they doing this?

938
01:49:17,966 --> 01:49:22,285
We don't know why. But they are giving
us a hard time. This is out of trade!

939
01:49:26,206 --> 01:49:27,725
Aghas!

940
01:49:28,166 --> 01:49:32,965
Why are we here if you are not going
to tell us your problems?

941
01:49:34,686 --> 01:49:37,925
Don't worry.
We'll solve it for sure.

942
01:49:38,046 --> 01:49:41,725
But do not think of us
as a different person.

943
01:49:42,046 --> 01:49:47,045
If you have a problem,
a complaint, the mansion is there.

944
01:49:49,886 --> 01:49:51,645
Good day.

945
01:49:52,206 --> 01:49:54,445
I'm sorry, Malhun Hatun.

946
01:49:54,646 --> 01:49:58,605
Just as we taught we are back on the
good again with the new leasing law...

947
01:49:58,606 --> 01:50:01,805
...foreign traders began to cripple us.

948
01:50:10,846 --> 01:50:12,285
Mother.

949
01:50:12,766 --> 01:50:18,005
We have to do something about that caravan.
Things are not going well in the marketplace.

950
01:50:18,566 --> 01:50:23,285
Ask all the shopkeepers. Find the merchants
who are doing this to our tradespeople.

951
01:50:24,246 --> 01:50:27,725
Let's understand what their issue is.

952
01:50:28,286 --> 01:50:33,325
They want to defeat us in trades, since they
could not defeat us in the battlefield, mother.

953
01:50:33,446 --> 01:50:36,285
But we will not let them do that.

954
01:50:38,606 --> 01:50:42,125
Come on then, Orhan Bey.
We have a lot of things to do.

955
01:51:04,246 --> 01:51:08,045
So he is getting ready for a siege, huh?

956
01:51:08,406 --> 01:51:11,045
Learn where the quarter is!

957
01:51:16,166 --> 01:51:17,925
If he's at headquarters...

958
01:51:18,286 --> 01:51:21,725
...Yenisehir, which he is proud of,
is defenseless.

959
01:51:23,806 --> 01:51:26,445
Weil get him in such a circle that...

960
01:51:27,126 --> 01:51:29,405
...he won't be able to
get out of there easily.

961
01:51:32,766 --> 01:51:38,005
Neither he nor his family,
not even one of them, will breathe.

962
01:51:38,926 --> 01:51:44,485
Tonight I will wipe Osman
and his family off the earth.

963
01:51:46,326 --> 01:51:48,565
Are you going to kill him at the quarters?

964
01:51:50,646 --> 01:51:53,965
This army will descend on Osman.

965
01:51:55,846 --> 01:51:57,325
What about the mansion?

966
01:52:10,726 --> 01:52:12,685
Why did we stop?

967
01:52:15,486 --> 01:52:17,285
Are you waiting for someone?

968
01:52:32,486 --> 01:52:34,365
Soldiers!

969
01:53:15,886 --> 01:53:18,085
Even if you hadn't come..

970
01:53:18,886 --> 01:53:22,085
...the loyal soldiers would have saved me.

971
01:54:07,846 --> 01:54:10,525
But now, their duty is going to be...

972
01:54:11,286 --> 01:54:15,045
...destroying the mansion of Osman.

973
01:54:19,766 --> 01:54:22,845
This thing will be done tonight.

974
01:54:36,006 --> 01:54:40,525
When everything is over,
I will deal with you, Bayindir.

975
01:54:41,366 --> 01:54:43,525
Sure, sure.

976
01:54:44,206 --> 01:54:47,245
If dogs' prayers were accepted...

977
01:55:28,366 --> 01:55:31,085
Do not wait here! Walk faster!

978
01:55:34,726 --> 01:55:37,005
I'm talking to you

979
01:55:37,606 --> 01:55:40,445
You, huh?

980
01:56:08,166 --> 01:56:10,245
Do not bother yourselves, Beys.

981
01:56:10,646 --> 01:56:13,645
Give that thing in your hand
back to me, you bandit.

982
01:56:13,646 --> 01:56:15,765
That's what you wish for.

983
01:56:35,486 --> 01:56:37,005
Thanks to Allah.

984
01:56:49,206 --> 01:56:51,005
Come on, valiants!

985
01:56:58,406 --> 01:57:02,405
-Are the preparations complete?
-We'll be ready during the night.

986
01:57:04,526 --> 01:57:09,165
We have only one thing missing.
That's the map of passages Konur will bring.

987
01:57:10,166 --> 01:57:12,645
We will receive the map.

988
01:57:17,246 --> 01:57:19,405
And Alps are training.

989
01:57:25,326 --> 01:57:28,485
But we will enter through the passages.
Now tell me.

990
01:57:28,886 --> 01:57:32,165
What will be your move
when the gate is open?

991
01:57:32,486 --> 01:57:34,885
Osman Bey... Now...

992
01:57:35,126 --> 01:57:40,605
Whichever way your gate leads,
we must first open the eastern gate.

993
01:57:41,046 --> 01:57:44,805
This gate is important.
The largest gate is the gate on the east.

994
01:57:44,806 --> 01:57:48,325
We need to attack quickly
and outnumber them at once.

995
01:57:48,366 --> 01:57:51,765
I will make a sudden attack
with the cavalry there.

996
01:57:53,806 --> 01:57:58,965
As for the west and south,
it is close to our archer units.

997
01:57:59,606 --> 01:58:05,005
While the archers will shoot arrows
the infantry will make a sudden attack.

998
01:58:06,726 --> 01:58:09,605
And the infantry will be under
the command of...

999
01:58:11,686 --> 01:58:13,085
..Aktemur.

1000
01:58:31,166 --> 01:58:33,885
Konur should have arrived by now.

1001
01:58:37,366 --> 01:58:39,565
I hope nothing bad happened to him.

1002
01:58:39,846 --> 01:58:44,525
If something bad happens,
Konur will be able to get over it.

1003
01:58:45,006 --> 01:58:46,765
Right, brother Boran?

1004
01:58:48,166 --> 01:58:53,645
Brothers... Konur has fulfilled duties
even in the Constantine and Konya.

1005
01:58:54,966 --> 01:58:57,445
He will fulfill this duty
as well, InshaAllah.

1006
01:58:57,566 --> 01:58:59,645
InshaAllah. InshaAllah.

1007
01:59:00,246 --> 01:59:03,805
You are right, Boran Alp.
Let's do our duty now.

1008
01:59:16,966 --> 01:59:19,845
Horses will not enter
only from the east side.

1009
01:59:20,566 --> 01:59:23,525
We can't risk our plan
like that all at once.

1010
01:59:24,406 --> 01:59:26,885
Thus, they will enter from the west..

1011
01:59:29,446 --> 01:59:31,765
..and the south as well.

1012
01:59:33,926 --> 01:59:37,645
As you said, we will start the attack
with horses from another side.

1013
01:59:37,846 --> 01:59:39,885
Yes.

1014
01:59:41,726 --> 01:59:44,445
The gates must be open for that attack.

1015
01:59:45,926 --> 01:59:49,125
And to open the gates, we need...
-The map.

1016
01:59:51,926 --> 01:59:54,645
Konur has to come back
as soon as possible.

1017
02:00:04,006 --> 02:00:06,245
He will.

1018
02:00:07,366 --> 02:00:09,725
He will get over all the hardships...

1019
02:00:10,646 --> 02:00:12,445
and he will come.

1020
02:00:13,086 --> 02:00:15,405
Don't worry.

1021
02:00:19,166 --> 02:00:21,005
Don't forget, Nayman.

1022
02:00:21,246 --> 02:00:25,005
You and I both have issues with Osman.

1023
02:00:25,766 --> 02:00:29,805
When you destroy
Osman you will give me the lands.

1024
02:00:31,526 --> 02:00:33,805
As long as you are loyal to me

1025
02:00:34,006 --> 02:00:37,365
you will be in your lands
however you want.

1026
02:00:37,726 --> 02:00:43,285
Ismihan, I need loyal people not rebels.

1027
02:00:48,486 --> 02:00:50,085
Karancu.

1028
02:00:52,406 --> 02:00:55,165
You'll be the head of soldiers.

1029
02:00:55,646 --> 02:00:59,565
After the sunset, you'll raid the mansion.

1030
02:01:00,166 --> 02:01:02,605
Not even a single person
will survive there.

1031
02:01:03,006 --> 02:01:06,285
You will not capture old people...

1032
02:01:06,566 --> 02:01:09,565
...children or women. Come on.

1033
02:01:22,846 --> 02:01:24,205
Kam.

1034
02:01:31,166 --> 02:01:32,925
Bayindir.

1035
02:01:37,326 --> 02:01:39,965
You wanted to be forgiven.

1036
02:01:42,126 --> 02:01:44,325
Now this is your chance.

1037
02:01:45,246 --> 02:01:49,925
You'll go to Yenisehir with Karancu
and the (Mongol) soldiers.

1038
02:01:52,526 --> 02:01:56,405
Every drop of blood you shed from
Osman's house

1039
02:01:57,366 --> 02:02:01,325
will take you one step further
towards forgiveness, Bayindir.

1040
02:02:07,166 --> 02:02:11,405
I'll do everything to be forgiven by you,

1041
02:02:11,926 --> 02:02:14,285
Hadhrat Mother Sultan.

1042
02:02:16,206 --> 02:02:17,605
Come on.

1043
02:02:36,686 --> 02:02:38,525
Prepare a unity

1044
02:02:39,046 --> 02:02:41,525
with the strongest and

1045
02:02:41,886 --> 02:02:45,485
the most talented soldiers.

1046
02:02:45,686 --> 02:02:47,485
I will.

1047
02:02:48,926 --> 02:02:53,045
I will. But it feels wrong, my Bey.

1048
02:02:54,366 --> 02:02:56,725
This oppression is too much.

1049
02:02:57,606 --> 02:02:59,645
We will pay for this in the after life.

1050
02:03:01,166 --> 02:03:04,765
Yes Huseyin. We will.

1051
02:03:07,806 --> 02:03:10,045
You do as I say. Come on.

1052
02:03:10,926 --> 02:03:12,485
Alright.

1053
02:03:26,326 --> 02:03:29,245
Yenisehir
Osman Bey's Mansion

1054
02:03:30,246 --> 02:03:32,845
Did you find the location of the Hospice, Bala?

1055
02:03:32,966 --> 02:03:35,605
We searched but we couldn't find a place for it.

1056
02:03:35,606 --> 02:03:39,045
It has to be somewhere in the center.
We'll check again tomorrow.

1057
02:03:39,126 --> 02:03:42,925
We also want to do our best Bala Hatun.
Do not think of us separately.

1058
02:03:43,886 --> 02:03:45,805
May you live long Bengi Hatun.

1059
02:03:46,526 --> 02:03:48,885
Alcicek is also very ambitious.

1060
02:03:50,086 --> 02:03:53,565
We'll do this together.
-She told me.

1061
02:03:54,926 --> 02:03:58,365
Don't worry about the
construction business, Bala Hatun.

1062
02:03:58,366 --> 02:04:02,285
There is a good bricklayer we know.
I already informed him.

1063
02:04:03,206 --> 02:04:06,565
MashaAllah Bengi Hatun.
You rushed.

1064
02:04:06,606 --> 02:04:08,445
We just talked about it today.

1065
02:04:08,446 --> 02:04:11,405
Good deeds must be
done quickly, Ayse Hatun.

1066
02:04:12,166 --> 02:04:15,925
Well done, Bengi Hatun.
You compete a lot in charity.

1067
02:04:18,046 --> 02:04:21,725
Alcicek, I know you just married.

1068
02:04:22,166 --> 02:04:25,605
But when do you want to have children?

1069
02:04:28,166 --> 02:04:30,885
Mother! Why are you talking
about this in here?!

1070
02:04:30,886 --> 02:04:36,085
mother, other one is her mother in law,
and the others are her aunts in law.

1071
02:04:36,086 --> 02:04:38,405
And don't you know why I am asking?
-Yes.

1072
02:04:38,806 --> 02:04:40,565
Besides, my mother is a midwife.

1073
02:04:41,686 --> 02:04:46,125
They've got married recently, The Dark Midwife.
There will be a time for that too.

1074
02:04:46,366 --> 02:04:48,885
There isn't a proper time for a baby, Bengi Hatun.

1075
02:04:49,006 --> 02:04:50,805
If a baby arrived...

1076
02:04:50,886 --> 02:04:54,965
...our house would be full of joy with
a baby's sound. Right, The Dark Midwife?

1077
02:04:55,006 --> 02:04:57,045
Yes. Yes.

1078
02:05:01,646 --> 02:05:05,085
-Can I come in?
-Come in, Esma.

1079
02:05:08,806 --> 02:05:12,605
Bala Hatun, Halime...
I just couldn't put her to sleep.

1080
02:05:13,526 --> 02:05:15,805
She must have heard her aunt Ayse.

1081
02:05:17,886 --> 02:05:19,925
Let me check her.

1082
02:05:25,406 --> 02:05:27,965
Eat some dessert, daughter.

1083
02:05:32,766 --> 02:05:37,325
Let's say we captured Kopruhisar.
What is the next?

1084
02:05:37,566 --> 02:05:42,005
Once we capture Kopruhisar,
we'll move according to the information.

1085
02:05:42,846 --> 02:05:46,405
But I want to take the lands
up to Koyunhisar quickly.

1086
02:05:46,726 --> 02:05:49,325
-Right.
-My Bey.

1087
02:05:49,766 --> 02:05:53,005
Shall we send a few alps after Konur?
It's being late.

1088
02:05:53,166 --> 02:05:56,125
If they know about us,
they will close the passes.

1089
02:05:56,326 --> 02:05:59,725
He'll arrive sooner or later.
But tell me...

1090
02:06:00,126 --> 02:06:02,685
Are alps watching around the headquarters?

1091
02:06:02,766 --> 02:06:05,365
Alps never sleep.

1092
02:06:06,006 --> 02:06:09,125
-They watch all around.
-Alright.

1093
02:06:09,446 --> 02:06:12,165
Until we get news from Konur...

1094
02:06:12,486 --> 02:06:14,725
..let's see whether alps are ready or not.

1095
02:06:29,246 --> 02:06:33,165
Something must have happened to him.
Otherwise, he would be here now.

1096
02:06:33,886 --> 02:06:36,205
Brother, I assume...

1097
02:06:37,446 --> 02:06:39,485
My Bey is coming. Come on.

1098
02:06:46,366 --> 02:06:51,645
Alps, we will march towards
Kopruhisar after the morning prayer.

1099
02:06:54,806 --> 02:06:57,805
My Bey, is there some news from Konur?

1100
02:06:58,646 --> 02:07:01,285
No.
Not yet.

1101
02:07:02,966 --> 02:07:06,525
In any case,
we will march to Kopruhisar.

1102
02:07:06,766 --> 02:07:10,805
Intelligence is the key of victory.
Without it...

1103
02:07:16,406 --> 02:07:20,965
we will take the rough path. But with
Allah's permission, we will receive news.

1104
02:07:21,446 --> 02:07:23,485
Thank you my Bey.

1105
02:07:24,286 --> 02:07:26,925
If Allah permits, if Allah permits.

1106
02:07:27,086 --> 02:07:30,245
The arrow will hit the target Osman Bey.

1107
02:07:30,446 --> 02:07:34,525
No difficulty will be able to stop us.

1108
02:07:34,806 --> 02:07:37,085
Thank you, thank you.

1109
02:07:40,726 --> 02:07:42,325
- Boran!
- My Bey?

1110
02:07:42,325 --> 02:07:44,155
Play the qopuz.

1111
02:07:45,086 --> 02:07:47,325
Play it and let us enjoy.

1112
02:07:48,206 --> 02:07:50,245
Yes my Bey.

1113
02:08:12,926 --> 02:08:40,385
I am burning with the love of Muhammed PBUH

1114
02:08:40,846 --> 02:09:04,005
I am deeply following Muhammad (PBUH)

1115
02:09:07,326 --> 02:09:12,805
I am burning with the love of Muhammad (PBUH)

1116
02:09:13,006 --> 02:09:18,085
I am deeply following the path of Muhammad (PBUH)

1117
02:09:18,366 --> 02:09:23,285
His Ummah(community)
is always grateful

1118
02:09:23,686 --> 02:09:29,245
My Allah, make me fall
in love with Muhammed!

1119
02:09:34,566 --> 02:09:39,765
I pray endlessly to Allah, the Almighty

1120
02:09:39,846 --> 02:09:45,085
So that there shall be no love in my
heart apart from Muhammad's (PBUH)

1121
02:09:45,166 --> 02:09:50,525
I am burning with the love of Muhammad (PBUH)

1122
02:09:50,566 --> 02:09:56,085
I am deeply following the path of Muhammad (PBUH)

1123
02:10:35,646 --> 02:10:37,685
Burn the mansion from inside.

1124
02:10:38,126 --> 02:10:41,605
When Yenisehir sees the flares,
they will all have died.

1125
02:10:43,926 --> 02:10:47,965
No daughter, no Halime.
What's wrong with you my child?

1126
02:10:56,846 --> 02:11:00,805
May my beautiful daughter go to sleep.
My Halime.

1127
02:11:23,686 --> 02:11:25,805
Bengi Hatun, eat halva.

1128
02:11:39,166 --> 02:11:43,285
Any news from the alps
we sent after Nayman?

1129
02:11:43,446 --> 02:11:48,405
No news yet. But I can see that
there is something that bothers you.

1130
02:11:49,846 --> 02:11:51,365
What happened Osman Bey?

1131
02:11:51,566 --> 02:11:55,965
We go to the west, you think about the east,
we go to the east, you don't forget the west.

1132
02:11:55,966 --> 02:12:00,645
-There is something that bothers you.
-He always suffered, never found comfort

1133
02:12:00,806 --> 02:12:04,805
You are the miracle of Muhammad's (PBUH) grief

1134
02:12:05,006 --> 02:12:10,245
I am burning with the love of Muhammad (PBUH)

1135
02:12:10,326 --> 02:12:15,645
I am deeply following the path of Muhammad (PBUH)

1136
02:12:26,406 --> 02:12:31,725
The Shah of Shahs asked for
the forgiveness of his ummah

1137
02:12:31,886 --> 02:12:37,685
We do not have to fear the Day of Resurrection,
thanks to Muhammad (PBUH)

1138
02:12:42,726 --> 02:12:47,765
I'd be dispersed by your grace, my Allah

1139
02:12:47,926 --> 02:12:53,125
Give me a drop
from the sea of Muhammad (PBUH)

1140
02:12:53,326 --> 02:12:58,405
As I am burning with the love of Muhammad (PBUH)

1141
02:12:58,646 --> 02:13:04,445
I am deeply following the path of Muhammad (PBUH)

1142
02:13:14,846 --> 02:13:19,885
I choose to be taken over...

1143
02:13:20,206 --> 02:13:25,885
...By love for Muhammad (PBUH)

1144
02:13:30,846 --> 02:13:36,285
Poor Yesevi longs to see the blessed grave

1145
02:13:36,326 --> 02:13:41,565
Will I be granted to reach your feet's soil

1146
02:13:41,686 --> 02:13:46,925
As I am burning with the love of Muhammad (PBUH)

1147
02:13:47,046 --> 02:13:52,365
I am deeply following the path of Muhammad (PBUH)

1148
02:13:52,486 --> 02:13:57,485
As I am burning with the love of Muhammad (PBUH)

1149
02:13:57,806 --> 02:14:03,165
I am deeply following the path of Muhammad (PBUH)

1150
02:14:05,966 --> 02:14:07,365
Praise be.

1151
02:14:07,606 --> 02:14:10,485
Thank you Boran. Thank you.

1152
02:14:10,926 --> 02:14:12,885
Thank you, my Bey.

1153
02:14:17,406 --> 02:14:19,725
-They're attacking
-Alps!

1154
02:14:21,286 --> 02:14:23,285
Alps!

1155
02:14:25,846 --> 02:14:29,725
My Halime.

1156
02:14:41,246 --> 02:14:44,845
Alps! They're attacking

1157
02:15:02,686 --> 02:15:05,685
-Osman!
-Nayman.

1158
02:15:06,086 --> 02:15:10,445
I promised you,
I said I would come to kill you.

1159
02:15:10,726 --> 02:15:15,725
I have the seal,
I have the power. All you have left is death!

1160
02:15:24,046 --> 02:15:26,165
Fire!

1161
02:15:43,886 --> 02:15:48,605
Not only yourself, your loved ones
will also die tonight Osman!

1162
02:15:49,166 --> 02:15:52,925
Yenisehir is burning,
you headquarters is burning

1163
02:15:53,526 --> 02:15:56,245
Your fire will be your hell.

1164
02:16:09,926 --> 02:16:13,005
Turgut. Take alps and go east.

1165
02:16:13,126 --> 02:16:15,365
Don't let them surround us!

1166
02:16:15,446 --> 02:16:17,725
Come with me to the east alps! Come on!

1167
02:16:17,766 --> 02:16:21,125
-Boran. Go after them.
-Gather your arrows brave boys

1168
02:16:21,206 --> 02:16:23,165
-Come on!
-Show them your arrows!

1169
02:16:23,326 --> 02:16:27,405
-Cerkutay. Go to south.
-Come on brothers!

1170
02:16:27,446 --> 02:16:29,845
Aktemur, come with me. Come on.

1171
02:16:31,086 --> 02:16:34,365
-Come on!
- Hide, Alaeddin.

1172
02:16:37,004 --> 02:16:39,885
Malhun! Bala!

1173
02:16:40,206 --> 02:16:42,285
-Mother!
-Mother Malhun!

1174
02:16:42,486 --> 02:16:45,565
-Orhan!
-Mother, are you all right?

1175
02:16:46,924 --> 02:16:50,485
-Alaeddin!
-Are you all right mother?

1176
02:17:30,806 --> 02:17:32,365
O Haqq!

1177
02:17:46,566 --> 02:17:48,205
O Allah!

1178
02:17:48,793 --> 02:18:08,633
